  "reviewNotes": {
    "architecture": "All five diagrams reviewed against the recorded baselines plus the complete-portfolio working-tree changes. Research/report now shows atomic input limits and explicit terminated-task continuation; strategy/simulation now shows timestamped observation coverage. System boundaries, channel seal/outbox publication and real-ledger transaction/import semantics are unchanged.",
    "behavior": "Complete frozen holdings/cash/limits/IDs/times survive native/API/workflow work and review packing or fail before dispatch. Explicit resume-report compares actual saved opening wire input, retains old findings/tasks, appends the necessary full-context check/summary and preserves original incomplete coverage. Simulation review counts distinct observation times, separates model notes from actual gaps and visibly distinguishes ledger reviews from research. Documentation does not certify a live deployment or research result.",
    "tooling": "Complete-portfolio changes do not modify the context helpers or CI integration; their prior verification remains separate from the new application behavior review.",
    "testFixtures": "CI crossed Shanghai midnight: three integration suites now align scenario clocks and dates; stale-report and ledger guards remain unchanged. These test-only changes do not alter any of the five architecture flows.",
    "concurrentMain": "PR #80 (f0fb2a0) inspected during final integration: added saved daily-report recovery, returnedDocumentId and readable simulation review projections. Repository/research references and report diagram updated; other architecture flows unchanged. Date fixture fixes preserve both calendar derivation and deterministic clocks.",
    "completePortfolioResearch": "Reviewed against 65c388e plus working-tree changes on 2026-11-07, not an uncreated release commit. Checked council input packers, resume reservation and correction-bound reverse-check selection, report coverage/body publication, simulation review timestamps and archived/category readers. Retained independent openings are never retroactively labelled complete after supplementation; formatting recovery remains separate from explicit AI continuation.",
    "unchangedFlows": "Diagram 1: route/module/auth/provider and database boundaries remain the same. Diagram 4: report/category/coverage changes do not alter finding seals, template checks, semantic deduplication or transactional outbox. Diagram 5: no holdings/cash/transaction import or reconstruction mutation is introduced. Diagram 3 changes only the review branch; explicit strategy confirmation, source fences and final order checks are unchanged.",
    "documentationVerification": "Context helper tests: 15 passed, zero skips, after rerunning outside the sandbox restriction on disposable Git metadata. Context checker: valid with no structural errors; its drift warning remains expected for the working tree. Document/reference changes passed whitespace checks and a retrieval check for resume-report, inputCorrection and valuationCoverage. These checks do not certify runtime research or deployment."
